# Generated RMG run output. The three decks here are meant to be RE-RUN in place, which
# repopulates all of this; none of it belongs in the source repo (see the prune commit
# for why). Ignored so that a later `git add docs/` cannot silently undo that.
#
# The evidence that IS tracked: each run's input.py and RMG.log.charge-excerpt, the
# before-run's stderr.log, the pytest logs, API-PROPOSAL.md, measure_net_charge.py and
# make_excerpts.sh.
chemkin/
cantera2/
cantera_from_ck/
pdep/
plot/
solver/
seed/
kinetics_database/
restart_from_seed.py
statistics.xls
RMG.log
stdout.log
rmgrc

# ...but keep the excerpts and the one stderr the before-silence claim rests on.
!*/RMG.log.charge-excerpt
!before-nonneutral/stderr.log

# the after-runs stderr and the empty pytest stderr carry nothing the claims rest on
*/stderr.log
!before-nonneutral/stderr.log
*.err
